-- Included: configuration columns only. Runtime state (last_run_at, counters,
-- errors, updated_by) is left to column defaults.
--
-- Deliberately NOT included:
--   * Secrets: intel_config (cron_secret, notify_secret), push_config (secret,
--     vapid_private, vapid_public), ingest_config (token hashes). Set these per
--     environment; never commit production values.
--   * Synced data that cron jobs rebuild: hfc_areas, control_areas,
--     lebanon_sects, telegram_agents.
--   * User and event data: profiles, events, media, logs, usage, learned_*.

